        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>Form 990, Part VI, Section B, line 12c</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>THE ACCEF REGULARLY AND CONSISTENTLY MONITORS AND ENFORCES COMPLIANCE WITH ITS CONFLICT OF INTEREST POLICIES THROUGH BOARD MEMBER MEETINGS ON A REGULAR BASIS AND ANNUAL CIRCULATION OF INQUIRY WITH ALL OFFICERS AND DIRECTORS.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>Form 990, Part VI, Section C, line 19</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>THE ACCEF MAKES ITS GOVERNING DOCUMENTS AVAILABLE THROUGH ITS WEBSITE AND TO THE PUBLIC UPON REQUEST. ALL GRANTS, SCHOLARSHIP AND STUDENTS SPONSORSHIP INFORMATION ARE AVAILABLE THROUGH ITS WEBSITE IN DETAILS. FINANCIAL STATEMENTS ARE INCORPORATED INTO THE FORM 990, WHICH, OF COURSE, IS AVAILABLE TO THE PUBLIC.</ExplanationTxt>
